--- code
function getClaimThroughLegacyApi(clearing: Clearing, settlementApi: LegacySettlementApi): LedgerClaim {
  const { isTypeSupported } = settlementApi;

  if (!isTypeSupported) {
    return LedgerClaim.Unknown;
  }

  return interpretAnswerWithoutScheme(clearing, house => Boolean(isTypeSupported.call(settlementApi, house)));
}
--- facts
These are host methods, and a bare call can be rejected outright on the ledgers that expose them, so the call keeps
its owner.
